<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .header h2 {
            color: #3266CC;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .content {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .success-badge {
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            display: inline-block;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #f4f7f6;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .info-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }
        .info-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .info-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #666;
        }
        .info-value {
            color: #333;
        }
        .amount {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #4CAF50;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .button-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .button {
            background-color: #3266CC;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999999;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="Abittoenergy Logo" style="max-width: 200px; height: auto;" />
        </div>
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Wallet Funded Successfully! 💰</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>
            
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <span class="success-badge">✓ Payment Received</span>
            </div>
            
            <p>Great news! Your wallet has been credited and is ready to use.</p>
            
            <div class="amount">₦{{amount}}</div>
            
            <div class="info-box">
                <p><strong>Transaction Details:</strong></p>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Amount Credited:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">₦{{amount}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">New Balance:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">₦{{newBalance}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Reference:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{reference}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Date:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{transactionDate}}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <p>Your funds are now available for gas purchases and other transactions on your account.</p>
            
            <div class="button-container">
                <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="button">View Wallet</a>
            </div>
            
            <p>Thank you for choosing Abittoenergy!</p>
            
            <p>Best regards,<br>The Abittoenergy Team</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Abittoenergy. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
